  "details": "The following group page management features appear to be enabled by the above role toggle:\n\n    The \"Invite\" tab on the website\n\n    The \"Settings>General\" tab on the website\n\n    The \"Delete group\" button on the website.\n\nOur group believes these permissions should be separate toggles; e.g. a group could choose to design roles such that:\n\nA Creator can do all three.\n\nA Admin can handle invites and update the webpage, but not delete the group.\n\nA moderator can handle invites but not delete or modify the webpage.",
